{#
settings/_calendar_behaviour.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
How the topbar's calendar button moves between views. Two switches, each
leaving out one stop of the three-way cycle:

  Skip the split view            mail ↔ the calendar full width
  Skip the full-width calendar   mail ↔ the calendar beside the mail

Both off is the cycle the button has always had. They exclude each other —
with both on the button would have nowhere to go — and User makes sure of
that: turning one on turns the other off.

Two forms, not one, so each posts only its own field. A single form would send
the other switch's old value along with the new one, and the server could not
tell which had just been moved. Both submit on change and redirect, like the
cards beside it: the switch decides what the NEXT page draws, so there is
nothing here worth streaming back.

Accepts:
  skipSplit  bool
  splitOnly  bool
#}
{% set segText = 'flex h-full items-center justify-center px-3 py-1.5 text-center text-[11px] leading-tight text-ink-muted
                  peer-checked:bg-accent peer-checked:text-accent-ink
                  peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-inset peer-focus-visible:ring-accent
                  transition-colors cursor-pointer' %}

<div class="px-4 py-3 space-y-4">
    {% for row in [
        { field: 'skipSplit', value: skipSplit, label: 'settings.calendar_behaviour.skip_split', hint: 'settings.calendar_behaviour.skip_split_hint' },
        { field: 'splitOnly', value: splitOnly, label: 'settings.calendar_behaviour.split_only', hint: 'settings.calendar_behaviour.split_only_hint' },
    ] %}
        <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_calendar_behaviour_update') }}" data-turbo="false" data-controller="ui--auto-submit">
            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-calendar-behaviour') }}">

            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
                <span class="min-w-0">
                    <span class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">{{ row.label|trans }}</span>
                    <span class="block text-[11px] text-ink-faint mt-0.5">{{ row.hint|trans }}</span>
                </span>

                <div class="grid grid-flow-col auto-cols-fr shrink-0 rounded-pane border border-line overflow-hidden"
                     role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ row.label|trans }}">
                    {% for on in [true, false] %}
                        <label>
                            <input type="radio" name="{{ row.field }}" class="peer sr-only"
                                   value="{{ on ? '1' : '0' }}"
                                   data-action="change->ui--auto-submit#submit"
                                   {{ row.value == on ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                            <span class="{{ segText }}">
                                {{ (on ? 'settings.calendar_behaviour.on' : 'settings.calendar_behaviour.off')|trans }}
                            </span>
                        </label>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>
    {% endfor %}
</div>
